            The same 40,000 BTU heater storing at 140 °F, across the range of groundwater temperatures a US
            house sees.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-8 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm">
            <table class="w-full text-left text-sm">
              <thead>
                <tr class="border-b border-slate-200 text-slate-500 bg-slate-50">
                  <th class="py-3 px-5 font-semibold">Inlet temperature</th>
                  <th class="py-3 px-5 font-semibold">Rise to 140 °F</th>
                  <th class="py-3 px-5 font-semibold">Recovery</th>
