              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener">US Department of Energy</a
            > water heater sizing guidance; recovery derived from the specific heat and density of water (8.33
            lb/gal). Storage and delivery temperature practice, including thermostatic mixing to limit
            scalding, follows <a
              class="underline hover:text-red-600"
              href="https://codes.iccsafe.org/codes/i-codes"
